Gale contains code derived from other projects:

- liquidctl (https://github.com/liquidctl/liquidctl), GPL-3.0-or-later.
  Protocol logic in crates/gale-hw-corsair/src/commander_pro.rs, commander_core.rs,
  hydro_platinum.rs and corsair_psu.rs is ported from liquidctl's drivers.
- LibreHardwareMonitor (https://github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor), MPL-2.0.
  The Nuvoton Super I/O driver in crates/gale-hw-superio is ported from
  LibreHardwareMonitorLib/Hardware/Motherboard/Lpc; those files keep their MPL-2.0 headers.
- PawnIO.Modules (https://github.com/namazso/PawnIO.Modules), LGPL-2.1.
  crates/gale-hw-superio embeds the signed LpcIO module binary unmodified.
